CLAUDE.md
# Local AI tooling stays untracked, except the awareness ledger, which is
# project memory and should travel with the repo. Git will not descend into an
# excluded directory, so each parent has to be re-included explicitly.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
.claude/skills/*
!.claude/skills/awareness-ledger/
.claude/skills/awareness-ledger/*
!.claude/skills/awareness-ledger/ledger/
.container
public_html
box
.claude-backups/
